# Rendered videos and caches are build output – regenerate with `python scripts/render.py all`.
# (The small metadata .json files next to the videos ARE kept.)
output/**/*.mp4
output/.cache/
output/last-run.json
output/qc-report.md
__pycache__/
*.pyc
# Large raw screen recordings stay local; register them with scripts/register_source.py
assets/gameplay/clips/*
!assets/gameplay/clips/README.md
